Z||000012||TheFiero64||01-01-2001||11:22 AM||||I have to get that book. I like the Fiero press guide that the Fiero store sells. I got that last Christmas. It has a lot of information in it. <P>------------------<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
Z||000013||Fformula88||01-01-2001||04:44 PM||||Both are great items.  I have the Press guide from the Fiero Store and enjoyed it.  For those unfamiliar with it, its basically filled with all the press information Pontiac handed out on the Fiero.  It has information on the build processes, construction, the body panels, engines etc etc.  Later years highlight improvements made to the car and stuff like that.  I think its worth having.<P>I have also read Gary Witzenburg's book TWICE cover to cover.  Its absolutely an awesome book on the Fiero.  I think its a must have (althought I have been borrowing it from the library).  I am not sure if its available from the publisher anymore.  I believe its officially "out of print".  BUT it can be had from the Fiero Store.  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
